Now implement the three-dots menu. Bootstrap 4 is loaded. Options:
- Use Bootstrap dropdown: 
```html
<div class="dropdown">
  <button class="btn btn-action btn-light" type="button" data-toggle="dropdown" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" title="Actions">
    <i class="fa fa-ellipsis-v"></i>
