3. Admin can update them — already has view + password reset + status; but likely also update details. We'll add editing fields in wholesaler-view (or a modal edit). "as you implemented before" maybe means the previously implemented management (view, suspend/activate). But add edit form anyway.

Also, the public wholesale registration simplification is still requested from prior message:
