.sf-price-compare { color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); }
.sf-unit { color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); }
.sf-product-category { color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); }
```
Also product-code/desc if used: `.sf-product-desc, .sf-product-code { color:#fff...}`.

Hover card border red currently; card border red on hover okay.

Need ensure price compare strikethrough visible.

Let's edit CSS.

