Now CSS for style.css. Append before print or at end. Add styles for topbar bell, dropdown, notification page list, toast stack.

Let's craft CSS consistent with theme.

```css
/* ---------------- Notifications ---------------- */
.topbar-notify { position: relative; }
.topbar-icon-btn {
  position: relative;
  width: 40px; height: 40px;
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);
  transition: background .15s ease, color .15s ease;
}
.topbar-icon-btn:hover { background: var(--bg); color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; }
.topbar-icon-btn i { font-size: 17px; }
.topbar-notify-badge {
  position: absolute; top: 3px; right: 2px;
  min-width: 17px; height: 17px; padding: 0 4px;
  border-radius: 999px; background: var(--primary); color: #fff;
  font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 17px; text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #fff;
}
.topbar-notify-badge[hidden] { display: none; }
.topbar-notify-menu { width: 360px; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; }
.topbar-notify-head { display:flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items:center; padding: 13px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft); }
...
```

Note badge hidden attribute when set via property `badge.hidden = true` works. When `hidden` attr present but CSS display inline-flex could override hidden? `[hidden] { display: none; }` included.

Notification rows in page:
```css
.notification-list { padding: 4px 18px 18px; }
.notification-row { display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; padding:16px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-soft); text-decoration:none; color:var(--text); border-radius:10px; }
.notification-row:hover { background:#faf9fc; }
.notification-row.is-unread { background: var(--primary-soft); }
...
```

Toast stack:
```css
.app-toast-stack { position: fixed; right: 22px; bottom: 22px; z-index: 1080; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; width: 340px; max-width: calc(100vw - 32px); pointer-events:none; }
.app-toast { pointer-events:auto; display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start; background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--border); border-left:4px solid var(--primary); border-radius:12px; box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(23,17,65,.18); padding:13px 14px; opacity:0; transform: translateY(14px) scale(.98); transition: opacity .24s ease, transform .24s ease; }
.app-toast.is-visible { opacity:1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
.app-toast.is-leaving { opacity:0; transform: translateY(10px) scale(.98); }
.app-toast.is-clickable { cursor:pointer; }
.app-toast.is-clickable:hover { border-color: #f0c9cd; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(23,17,65,.24); }
.app-toast-icon { width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:10px; background: var(--primary-soft); color: var(--primary); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0; font-size:15px; }
.app-toast-content { min-width:0; flex:1; }
.app-toast-title { font-size:13.5px; font-weight:800; color:var(--text); line-height:1.3; }
.app-toast-message { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:3px; line-height:1.4; }
.app-toast-time { font-size:11px; color:#9a94a8; margin-top:5px; }
.app-toast-close { border:0; background:transparent; color:#b3aebe; font-size:19px; line-height:1; padding:0 2px; cursor:pointer; }
.app-toast-close:hover { color: var(--primary); }
