Now update JS. Add functions and event handlers. The `$(function(){` block starts at line ~701. Add inside:
- setCartOpen function defined outside or inside.
- Bind toggle/close/backdrop/Escape.
- Sync on load.

Let's add before `function addToCart` maybe inside script after the document ready block or within. Define `setCartOpen` globally:

```js
function setCartOpen(open) {
    $('#posCartPanel').toggleClass('is-open', open);
    $('#posCartBackdrop').toggleClass('is-open', open);
    $('body').toggleClass('pos-cart-open', open);
}
```

Inside `$(function () { ... })`, add:
```js
$('#posCartToggle').on('click', function () { setCartOpen(true); });
$('#posCartClose, #posCartBackdrop').on('click', function () { setCartOpen(false); });
$(document).on('keydown', function (e) {
    if (e.key === 'Escape') setCartOpen(false);
});
if ($('#posCartPanel').hasClass('is-open')) {
    setCartOpen(true);
}
```

But `posCartPanel` might not exist if no selected shop; guarded.

Could auto-open only on small screens? The class sync is fine.

Also after AJAX `persistRow` removes item, page reload. No need update count.

Potential issue: Clicking product row inside mobile overlay? The overlay only covers when open. Fine.

Now CSS. Modify assets/css/style.css POS section:

- `.pos-layout { display:flex; gap:22px; align-items:flex-start; }` already exists.
- `.pos-cart { width:400px; min-width:380px; position: sticky; top: 86px; }` remove `.pos-cart.is-empty`.
- Add `.pos-cart-close, .pos-cart-toggle, .pos-cart-backdrop { display:none; }`
- Add mobile media query.

Also `.pos-search` sticky top 86px; on mobile, topbar is fixed 64px. Fine.

Need to account for the sidebar: `.pos-layout` is inside `.app-content`, so width fits. Good.

Mobile CSS:
```css
@media (max-width: 991.98px) {
  .pos-layout { display: block; }
  .pos-products { width: 100%; }
  .pos-cart {
    position: fixed;
    left: 0;
