Let's edit header layout first.

Current `.sf-header-inner` flex. Change to grid:
```css
.sf-header-inner {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1240px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 420px) minmax(280px, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 22px;
}
```
But company name could exceed 420 and truncate. Fine.
