```css
.sf-header-inner { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; }
```
Add `display:flex;`. Then brand/actions/search order rules work.

At <=900, we previously removed wrap rules? We haven't yet. The 900 block still has:
```css
